  "description": "MCPInvoke is a complete Model Context Protocol (MCP) server implementation for ASP.NET Core applications. Originally designed as a companion to MCPBuckle for tool execution, MCPInvoke now provides full MCP protocol support including tool discovery and execution. Version 1.3.0 adds complete MCP protocol compliance with support for initialize, tools/list, and Claude Code CLI integration.",
